FILTERS IN EBIRDS
__________________
make diff_filters
# To verify the Chimbo filter is working well:
make verify_filter

To get the infos:
https://review.ebird.org/admin/viewFilter.htm?checklistID=CL24828 => Save as active_filter.html
https://review.ebird.org/admin/viewFilter.htm?checklistID=CL34436 => Save as chimbo_filter.html

